`Good news — ${provisioned.hostname} is yours.

Collect your tunnel credentials and the setup steps here:

${claimUrl}

The link works once and expires in two weeks. Treat the file it gives you
like an SSH key: anyone holding it can serve traffic on your subdomain.

— hop`);
